/description_i18n/cn","冰龙卷风对所处格子上的敌人造成伤害提高至70% + 7% ATK，对1格范围内的敌人造成伤害提高至35% + 3% ATK。小型龙卷风所处格子上的敌人造成伤害提高至35% + 3% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","氷の竜巻が竜巻マス上の敵に与えるダメージが70% + 7% ATKにUPし、半径1マス以内の敵に与えるダメージが35% + 3% ATKにUP。小型の氷の竜巻が竜巻マス上の敵に与えるダメージが35% + 3% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":52,"end":57,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":85,"end":90,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":59,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":99,"end":104,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":82,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":56,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":96,"end":108,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","无尽冰锋"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","無限の氷刃"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","发射多枚冰刺，对命中的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","複数の氷の棘を発射し、ヒットした敵にダメージを与える"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在自身前方生成5支冰刺，随后发射出去，对命中的敌人造成140% + 20% ATK伤害。“寒冬护盾”持续期间，本技能的冷却时间降低至3秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","自身の前方に5本の氷の棘を生成し、発射する。ヒットした敵に140% + 20% ATKのダメージを与える。「寒冬シールド」存在期間中、このスキルのCDは3秒に短縮される"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skill